BetterGuac changes to Apache Guacamole 1.6.0 in this package:
- guacd: FreeRDP 3 graphics (GDI) set up in the post-connect callback
  instead of before connecting, which fixes RDP crashes with FreeRDP 3.
- guacamole-auth-jdbc-mysql: deleting user groups works, and the sign-in
  history table is written correctly (bytecode patch of the 1.6.0 jar).
- Web application: BetterGuac page title and early midnight-blue page
  colour in index.html; javax.* converted to jakarta.* for Tomcat 10.
- BetterGuac interface add-on and profile extension (new code).
- YAML-to-database sync tool (new code).

